/", "caption": "I thought hiring a cleaner would be a splurge.\n\nThen I compared it to what I was already spending when I felt overwhelmed \u2014 especially takeout.\n\nGoing bi-weekly made it much more affordable, and it ended up feeling more like a swap than an extra expense.\n\n\ud83d\udccd Montreal\nGet your quote through the link in our bio.\n\n#montreal #HomeCleaning #housecleaning #homecleaning", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:51:56.000Z", "videoDuration": 27.583855, "videoPlayCount": 1376, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 25, "commentsCount": 3, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ssn1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/811664978_17909513709540209_280415017921512248_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ig_cache_key=Mzk4NjgzMjQwMTQ3NjY0MTQzNzE3OTA5NTEzNzA2NTQwMjA5.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=bEZGn4S_LKoQ7kNvwF5MXH9&_nc_oc=AdoXUtdsSW1r3nuHmpLXNvjXJNY-Mj_JWmnj3Nnbxhl1pPCCI-B41lWUHl-o0cIf9bs&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-ssn1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=cThXuALmoMxgddEvDcFQig&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQJtL8W7BHa4-0m-_Xqi1goSurfrdkzFjtk3FiRzmNpmCA&oe=6AB5A624", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-fco2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQO11T-5936fdWhycBHB8XqCijaYUI81Pca3mS7mBZlqd2sAvWEzEyHIO-ZTjNfjva2kbhq1hrW447pZIp4WC8_a8Cv7S68Lo7XWBwY.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-fco2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=vJQYJvJv_TAQ7kNvwFZ_6HG&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTc5MDk1MTM1NTk1NDAyMDksImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjo0LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MjcsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=b19eded8fa24265f&_nc_&_nc_gid=mlocTTS_ozX0B6hSHVApLA&_nc_ss=7a22e&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQIQQNX6zimu1CSwpY72CeG6vBBoZD9YzgHoxlWMCPPRNQ&oe=6AB1D8EA", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "axiomcleaningservice", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "28565234679774700"}, "ownerUsername": "axiomcleaningservice", "ownerFullName": "Axiom Cleaning Service", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-20", "plays": 1376, "likes": 25, "comments": 3}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "A cleaner cost me less than what I was already spending. Three things made this affordable for me. One, I stopped calling it a splurge and started comparing it to things I already pay for without thinking twice. Two, bi-weekly instead of weekly. That alone cut it in half and the house stays just as good. Three, I started being honest with myself about what I was already spending to cope with being overwhelmed. Takeout mostly, that number was not small. It ended up being a swap and not an addition.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Personal Experience"}]}